    "Question #: 8": {
      "Title": "Exam 1z0-888 topic 1 question 16 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You want to create a temporary table named OLD_INVENTORY in the OLD_INVENTORY database on the master server. This table is not to be replicated to the slave server."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Which two changes would ensure that the temporary table does not propagate to the slave? (Choose two.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. Set binlog_format=MIXED with the --replicate-ignore-temp-table option."
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. Use the --replicate-do-db, --replicate-do-table, or --replicate-wild-do-table option with the value equal to OLD_INVENTORY."
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. Change the binlog_format option to ROW and restart mysqld before you create the OLD_INVENTORY table."
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. Stop SQL_THREAD on the slave until you have finished using the OLD_INVENTORY temporary table."
            }
          ]
        },
        "E": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "E. Use the --replicate-ignore-table option with the value equal to OLD_INVENTORY.OLD_INVENTORY and restart mysqld before creating the temporary table."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: BE \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          }
        ]
      },
